### [B-TC01] Get all available boxes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boxes

### [B-TC02] Get box by exact name (Matcha Lover Box)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/boxname/Matcha Lover Box

### [B-TC03] Get all items from all boxes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/items

### [B-TC07] Purchase 1 Matcha Lover Box (default)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box

### [B-TC08] Purchase 3 Matcha Lover Boxes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box?quantity=3

### [B-TC09] Try to purchase more boxes than items available (quantity=99)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box?quantity=99

### [B-TC10] Purchase a non-existent box
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Nonexistent Box

### [B-TC11] Purchase a box with invalid quantity (negative number)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box?quantity=-5

### [B-TC12] Purchase multiple box themes (valid names)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "boxName": "Matcha Lover Box", "quantity": 2 },
  { "boxName": "Chocolate Lover Box", "quantity": 1 }
]

### [B-TC13] Purchase with one valid and one invalid box name
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "boxName": "Matcha Lover Box", "quantity": 1 },
  { "boxName": "Nonexistent Box", "quantity": 2 }
]

### [B-TC14] Purchase with all invalid box names
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "boxName": "Fake Box A", "quantity": 1 },
  { "boxName": "Fake Box B", "quantity": 1 }
]

### [B-TC15] Test History API (GET all purchases)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/history